{
  "key_path": "LdapDisclaimer",
  "content": "Note: the user's email comes from the \"Mail Attribute\" setting. If that's missing, it's built as \"Login Attribute + @ + LDAP Domain.\" If neither produces a valid email, the user won't receive notifications.",
